; a state without next is an input at every time, its init notwithstanding:
; "first" is 1 only at time 0, so the bad state needs s = 10 at time 0
1 sort bitvec 4
2 sort bitvec 1
3 zero 1
4 state 1 s
5 init 1 4 3
6 one 2
7 zero 2
8 state 2 first
9 init 2 8 6
10 next 2 8 7
11 constd 1 10
12 eq 2 4 11
13 and 2 8 12
14 bad 13
